M ignores the fact these protests are a result of the said systems inadequate responses to inequalities, be they food, #MeToo #GlobalWarming etc.","media":null,"username":"Dturner300","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":44,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":9.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1297944346411651078","date":1598289021000,"rawContent":"Don't be fooled by this nonsense. Ignoring systemic change whilst offering up platitudes like this is designed to make the @BBC appear woke. It's real aim though is to irritate the Right who then take aim at the Other (in this case #BlackLivesMatter )\nIts oppression by proxy","media":null,"username":"Dturner300","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":45,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1297946635771748352","date":1598289567000,"rawContent":"Twitterati\nI have seen the #JacobBlake video and won't be sharing it here.\nI've also seen comments stating he was resisting arrest and had outstanding warrants, comments used to justify 7 shots in a black man's back.\nSo watch the #RacialTrauma as it's coming!\n#BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/wJvquqt92r","media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/tweet_video_thumb\/EgM7lPkX0AEuNVp.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/tweet_video\/EgM7lPkX0AEuNVp.mp4"]}],"username":"Dturner300","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":46,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,